WEBVTT

1
00:00:03.993 --> 00:00:16.462
Ben sat with his friends in the crowded hallway outside the nurse's office.

2
00:00:17.523 --> 00:00:19.665
Everyone was talking about the epidemic.

3
00:00:19.685 --> 00:00:24.148
"I wonder if we'll get to go home," a ghoul murmured.

4
00:00:24.168 --> 00:00:29.292
"I hope we don't need shots," said a three-eyed monster.

5
00:00:31.112 --> 00:00:35.555
Suddenly Mog shouted, "My purple spots are getting bigger!"

6
00:00:36.495 --> 00:00:38.516
His girlfriend, Lilly, looked nervous.

7
00:00:38.536 --> 00:00:44.299
"If those spots keep growing, your whole body will be purple."

8
00:00:44.319 --> 00:00:48.622
"My spots are growing too," said a goblin.

9
00:00:49.322 --> 00:00:50.263
He looked around.

10
00:00:50.283 --> 00:00:53.044
"Everyone's spots are growing!"

11
00:00:53.064 --> 00:00:56.826
"This is awful!"

12
00:00:57.226 --> 00:00:58.987
cried Jen, jiggling nervously.

13
00:00:59.007 --> 00:01:02.376
"What's happening to us?"

14
00:01:02.396 --> 00:01:03.737
"What are you worried about?"

15
00:01:04.138 --> 00:01:05.038
asked the goblin.

16
00:01:05.058 --> 00:01:07.280
"You were purple already!"

17
00:01:08.481 --> 00:01:09.983
Ben looked at his own hands.

18
00:01:10.763 --> 00:01:13.005
His spots were getting bigger and bigger too.

19
00:01:13.846 --> 00:01:15.347
He looked at Waldo and Gaby.

20
00:01:16.088 --> 00:01:17.989
They were completely purple by now.

21
00:01:19.010 --> 00:01:23.174
Mr. Freaky hurried down the hallway, his noses wiggling wildly.

22
00:01:23.194 --> 00:01:28.038
"We have a serious problem," the principal announced.

23
00:01:28.778 --> 00:01:30.560
His spots were growing as he spoke.

24
00:01:32.252 --> 00:01:36.336
"Mayor Hubbletree is sending over a health inspector to look into this epidemic.

25
00:01:37.237 --> 00:01:38.558
He's very upset.

26
00:01:39.199 --> 00:01:43.443
He plans to build a concrete wall between Monsterville and People Place.

27
00:01:45.766 --> 00:01:49.009
I don't think he'll ever let his students visit us."

28
00:01:50.550 --> 00:01:52.392
Ben and his friends exchanged looks.

29
00:01:53.814 --> 00:01:55.996
He'd already told them about the concrete wall.

30
00:01:58.912 --> 00:02:02.055
Mrs. Germ, the school nurse, came out of her office.

31
00:02:04.257 --> 00:02:05.858
Usually she was large and blue.

32
00:02:06.759 --> 00:02:08.901
But by now she was large and purple.

33
00:02:08.921 --> 00:02:13.345
"I can't find any information about this epidemic, Mr.

34
00:02:13.405 --> 00:02:14.926
Freaky," said the nurse.

35
00:02:14.946 --> 00:02:19.850
"Monster flu usually causes green spots, not purple."

36
00:02:22.452 --> 00:02:24.114
Mr. Freaky scratched his head.

37
00:02:24.134 --> 00:02:27.620
"What does that mean then?"

38
00:02:27.640 --> 00:02:31.221
"It means that we don't know what this disease is," said the nurse.

39
00:02:31.241 --> 00:02:34.482
"It must be more serious than we thought."

40
00:02:35.502 --> 00:02:36.523
Everyone gasped.

41
00:02:38.743 --> 00:02:41.264
Mr. Freaky's noses wiggled more than ever.

42
00:02:41.284 --> 00:02:46.525
"I'm placing Monster Academy under lockdown," continued Mrs.

43
00:02:46.565 --> 00:02:51.407
Germ. "Until everyone is well, we have to be quarantined."

44
00:02:51.427 --> 00:02:54.527
"What does quarantined mean?"

45
00:02:54.948 --> 00:02:56.168
Mog asked Waldo.

46
00:02:57.224 --> 00:02:59.465
"It means we can't leave," said Waldo.

47
00:02:59.485 --> 00:03:01.785
"That way we won't spread the disease."

48
00:03:04.086 --> 00:03:05.867
Ben heard Winnie gasp nearby.

49
00:03:05.887 --> 00:03:08.827
"Lockdown?" she echoed.

50
00:03:08.847 --> 00:03:12.869
"I was going to practice broom flying after school today!

51
00:03:12.889 --> 00:03:15.289
I have my flying test soon."

52
00:03:15.309 --> 00:03:20.891
"Yeah! I have a violin lesson today," complained another monster.

53
00:03:20.911 --> 00:03:23.792
"I wanted to go home and watch TV!"

54
00:03:25.340 --> 00:03:28.321
Mr. Freaky held up a hand to silence everyone.

55
00:03:28.341 --> 00:03:31.523
"This is nothing to worry about, students.

56
00:03:32.563 --> 00:03:35.264
We'll try to turn this into something fun."

57
00:03:35.284 --> 00:03:38.226
"Fun?" repeated a skeleton.

58
00:03:38.246 --> 00:03:40.867
"Since when is living at school fun?"

59
00:03:42.027 --> 00:03:43.968
The new cooking teacher strode over.

60
00:03:43.988 --> 00:03:48.430
"The cafeteria trolls and I can cook a lovely dinner for everyone.

61
00:03:49.891 --> 00:03:51.992
How does frog brain stew sound?"

62
00:03:53.060 --> 00:03:55.361
Murmurs of excitement ran through hallway.

63
00:04:00.483 --> 00:04:03.585
school I'll set up some games in the gym," said Mr.

64
00:04:03.625 --> 00:04:05.065
Gwarg, the PE teacher.

65
00:04:05.085 --> 00:04:09.447
"Can we fly brooms in the gym too?"

66
00:04:09.867 --> 00:04:11.088
asked Winnie hopefully.

67
00:04:11.108 --> 00:04:13.789
"No," said Mr.

68
00:04:13.829 --> 00:04:18.511
Freaky. "Unfortunately, Miss Bungle is still out sick."

69
00:04:18.531 --> 00:04:23.045
"Oh," said Winnie in a small voice.

70
00:04:24.026 --> 00:04:26.707
Then she murmured something else that Ben couldn't hear.

71
00:04:27.648 --> 00:04:28.848
He stole a glance at her.

72
00:04:28.868 --> 00:04:32.510
"Poor Winnie," he thought.

73
00:04:34.331 --> 00:04:38.173
She loved broom flying, and she couldn't wait to pass her flying test.

74
00:04:39.054 --> 00:04:42.756
Once she got her license, she could fly all over Monsterville on her own.

75
00:04:44.337 --> 00:04:48.379
He felt sorry for her, but he was glad to see that she was sitting with her friends

76
00:04:48.599 --> 00:04:49.640
and not with Zork.

77
00:04:51.632 --> 00:04:55.455
"It seems that everyone feels well despite the spots," Mr.

78
00:04:55.495 --> 00:04:56.435
Freaky was saying.

79
00:04:56.455 --> 00:04:59.778
"So I think you can all go to class."

80
00:05:00.558 --> 00:05:01.799
The students groaned.

81
00:05:03.340 --> 00:05:07.343
"When the school day is over, we'll have fun," Mr.

82
00:05:07.363 --> 00:05:08.263
Freaky promised.

83
00:05:08.283 --> 00:05:13.347
"Now I must get back to my office to alert your parents about the quarantine."

84
00:05:20.691 --> 00:05:23.313
students." At the end of the day, Mr.

85
00:05:23.373 --> 00:05:25.593
Freaky's voice came over the loudspeaker again.

86
00:05:25.613 --> 00:05:28.854
"We have set up activities throughout the school.

87
00:05:29.594 --> 00:05:31.015
Please try to have some fun.

88
00:05:32.135 --> 00:05:37.317
Even if we are all suffering from a terrible epidemic, things are still totally under control!"

89
00:05:37.337 --> 00:05:41.518
The bell clanged, and students dashed into the hallways.

90
00:05:41.538 --> 00:05:45.219
"I'm playing volleyball!"

91
00:05:45.599 --> 00:05:47.920
called out a fish monster, racing toward the gym.

92
00:05:48.668 --> 00:05:52.231
A group of trolls, goblins, and skeletons raced after him.

93
00:05:54.533 --> 00:05:56.415
Ben floated at the top of a stairwell.

94
00:05:56.435 --> 00:05:59.858
"Maybe I should look for Winnie," he thought.

95
00:06:01.780 --> 00:06:05.923
Maybe if he tried again to explain about the locked door, she would understand.

96
00:06:07.465 --> 00:06:12.229
Maybe he could even tell her about how he couldn't float through walls like a— "Oh!

97
00:06:12.369 --> 00:06:13.350
Ben! There you are."

98
00:06:13.670 --> 00:06:15.692
Suddenly Waldo was standing in front of him.

99
00:06:17.128 --> 00:06:20.070
"We must solve this mystery," the wizard declared.

100
00:06:20.090 --> 00:06:22.091
"What mystery?"

101
00:06:22.632 --> 00:06:23.212
asked Ben.

102
00:06:24.553 --> 00:06:26.154
Waldo adjusted his glasses.

103
00:06:26.174 --> 00:06:30.477
"The mystery of who tried to ruin my talk potion."

104
00:06:32.658 --> 00:06:34.019
Ben nodded slowly.

105
00:06:34.039 --> 00:06:38.562
"There are definitely some weird things happening at this school."

106
00:06:38.582 --> 00:06:42.485
"It can't be just a coincidence," said Waldo.

107
00:06:42.505 --> 00:06:46.828
"First purple fog filled the gym during the Monster Mash dance.

108
00:06:48.072 --> 00:06:49.516
And now we've all turned purple!"
